  "description": "Won Seung-oh, an outsider who completely ruined his college entrance exams, somehow enters the prestigious Seoul National University's Department of Romance alongside his arch-rival, Gyeon I-ji! The graduation requirement is simple: get married within exactly one year. Thus begins the agonizing and fierce struggle of Seung-oh, an absolute dating novice, trying to get married before the popular I-ji.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852623), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14451654)",
